msgid "STM32G474RET6 / MB1367 selected peripheral platform"
msgstr "STM32G474RET6／MB1367 选定外设平台"

msgid "This is a source-reviewed STM32G474RET6 baseline for NUCLEO-G474RE. It implements CPU startup, a fixed clock transaction, TIM2 time, package-valid GPIO on A/B/C/D/F/G, six UART IRQ byte controllers, SPI1/2 finite polling, TIM3/4 CH1 fixed-base PWM, independent IWDG and PA0/PA1 EXTI edge events. A separate silicon software fixture adds ADC1 PA0/IN1, finite TIM6-triggered normal DMA, I2C1 PB8/PB9 and full physical dual-bank Flash. That baseline alone does not establish other G4 peripheral modes. Independent software references now select [finite coupled PWM/ADC](pwm-adc.md) and [CAN FD](can-fd.md) under their own exact contracts. USB, Ethernet and low-power continuity remain outside these profiles. Unsupported modes fail the resolver; actual PCB inspection and all HIL remain not executed."
msgstr "这是 NUCLEO-G474RE 上经源码审阅的 STM32G474RET6 基线，实现 CPU startup、固定时钟事务、TIM2 时间、A/B/C/D/F/G 封装有效 GPIO、六个 UART IRQ 字节控制器、SPI1/2 有限 polling、TIM3/4 CH1 固定 base PWM、独立 IWDG 和 PA0/PA1 EXTI 边沿事件。独立芯片软件夹具新增 ADC1 PA0/IN1、TIM6 触发的有限普通 DMA、I2C1 PB8/PB9 及完整物理双 bank Flash。该基线本身不建立其他 G4 外设模式的支持。新增独立软件参考分别按各自精确合同选择[有限 PWM/ADC 联合采样](pwm-adc.md)和 [CAN FD](can-fd.md)。USB、Ethernet 和低功耗连续性仍不在这些配置范围内。不支持的模式在解析阶段失败；真实 PCB 检查和全部 HIL 仍未执行。"

