msgid "Exact target and memory"
msgstr "精确目标与内存"

msgid ""
"The exact target is STM32G474RET6, Cortex-M4F, ARMv7E-M, FPv4-SP-D16 hard "
"ABI, DSP and DWT CYCCNT. External IRQ IDs cover 0..101, including TIM2=28, "
"LPUART1=91 and FMAC=101. Four priority bits are implemented."
msgstr ""
"精确目标为 STM32G474RET6、Cortex-M4F、ARMv7E-M、FPv4-SP-D16 hard ABI，具有 DSP 与 DWT "
"CYCCNT。外部 IRQ ID 为 0..101，包括 TIM2=28、LPUART1=91、FMAC=101。实现四个优先级位。"

msgid ""
"Flash is 512 KiB at 0x08000000. Startup checks observed DEV_ID 0x469, Flash "
"density 512 KiB and actual DBANK=1. DEV_ID identifies a silicon category, "
"not the package or order code. DBANK=1 yields 2 KiB pages across two banks; "
"DBANK=0 is rejected by this first geometry profile. Startup never writes "
"option bytes or performs erase or programming. A product must verify the "
"exact order code and option state."
msgstr ""
"Flash 为 0x08000000 起 512 KiB。Startup 检查观察 DEV_ID 0x469、Flash density 512 KiB"
" 及实际 DBANK=1。DEV_ID 标识硅片类别，不标识封装或订货号。DBANK=1 是跨两 bank 的 2 KiB page；首 "
"geometry profile 拒绝 DBANK=0。Startup 绝不写 option bytes 或擦除／编程。产品须核对精确订货号和 "
"option 状态。"

msgid ""
"RAM consists of 80 KiB SRAM1 at 0x20000000, 16 KiB SRAM2 at 0x20014000, and "
"32 KiB CCM with a system-bus alias at 0x20018000. The CCM CPU address "
"0x10000000 aliases the same physical storage and is not counted again. The "
"default linker layout uses 96 KiB SRAM1/2 region at 0x20000000 and reserves "
"2048 bytes for MSP. These 96 KiB are DMA-visible. CCM is declared once at "
"0x10000000; silicon also permits DMA through its 0x20018000 alias (RM0440 "
"p89). The selected software policy excludes both CCM addresses from the "
"default linker region and generated DMA domains. No caller buffer is "
"silently relocated into another memory region."
msgstr ""
"RAM 包含 0x20000000 的 80 KiB SRAM1、0x20014000 的 16 KiB SRAM2，以及具有 0x20018000 "
"系统总线别名的 32 KiB CCM。CCM 的 CPU 地址 0x10000000 指向同一物理存储，不重复统计。默认 linker 使用 "
"0x20000000 的 96 KiB SRAM1/2 区域并为 MSP 预留 2048 字节；这 96 KiB 可由 DMA 访问。CCM 仅在 "
"0x10000000 声明一次；芯片也支持通过 0x20018000 别名进行 DMA（RM0440 p89）。当前软件策略从默认 linker "
"和生成的 DMA domain 排除两个 CCM 地址。不会静默搬移调用者 buffer。"

