msgid ""
"The fixed clock profile does not establish actual GPIO supply or load. A "
"Board must qualify its voltage, capacitance, pulse width and electrical path"
" before using the corresponding rate. No unconditional 85 MHz pad "
"performance or electrical safety is claimed by the software counter range."
msgstr ""
"固定时钟配置不建立实际 GPIO 供电或负载。使用对应速率前，Board 必须验证电压、电容、脉宽及电气路径。软件计数范围不声称无条件的 85 MHz "
"引脚性能或电气安全。"

msgid ""
"The [mainstream adaptation contract](mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md) describes"
" cross-family differences, source identities and the separate software/HIL "
"acceptance boundary. No G4 extension inherits F407 or another G4 part's "
"physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"[主流接入合同](mainstream-mcu-adaptation.md)说明跨系列差异、来源身份及独立的软件/HIL 验收边界。任何 G4 "
"扩展都不继承 F407 或其他 G4 料号的物理资格。"

msgid "Software evidence and outstanding qualification"
msgstr "软件证据与剩余资格"

msgid "Exact EXTI extension"
msgstr "精确 EXTI 扩展"

msgid ""
"`EXTI0`/PA0 and `EXTI1`/PA1 use independent IRQ6/7 with explicit priority "
"and caller-selected 1..4096 event slots. RM0440 Rev9 section10.2.3 pp367–368"
" gives the GPIOA zero encoding of each `SYSCFG_EXTICR1` field; "
"sections15.3–15.5 pp441–453 describe interrupt selection and W1C `EXTI_PR1`."
" The official CMSIS layout and exact-part package inventory supply the "
"register and pin facts. `tests/contracts/g474_assembly/exti_board` is only a"
" software fixture; it does not assert an actual NUCLEO button, connector, "
"bias resistor or electrical route."
msgstr ""
"`EXTI0`/PA0 与 `EXTI1`/PA1 使用独立 IRQ6/7、显式优先级和调用方选定 1..4096 事件槽。RM0440 Rev9 "
"10.2.3 节 367–368 页给出 `SYSCFG_EXTICR1` GPIOA 零编码；15.3–15.5 节 441–453 页说明中断选择与"
" W1C `EXTI_PR1`。官方 CMSIS "
"布局与精确料号封装清单提供寄存器／引脚事实。`tests/contracts/g474_assembly/exti_board` "
"仅为软件夹具，不声明真实 NUCLEO button、connector、bias resistor 或电气路由。"

msgid ""
"The common `edge-event` face has a single task reader and one IRQ producer "
"per line. Each invocation acknowledges one selected pending bit, samples at "
"most one level and records one timebase timestamp. Hardware edges may "
"coalesce; both-edge direction reflects the sampled level. No polling loop "
"reconstructs lost edges. A full ring preserves older events, exposes a "
"separate loss boundary and only then admits later events. CPU exclusion per "
"copied event is bounded; read work scales with the explicit caller capacity."
msgstr ""
"公共 `edge-event` 接口每条线有唯一任务 reader 和 IRQ producer。每次确认一个所选 pending bit，最多采样一个"
" level 并记录一个 timebase timestamp。硬件边沿可合并，双边沿方向反映采样 "
"level；没有轮询重建丢边沿。满环保留旧事件、开放独立 loss 边界，然后才接纳后续事件。每次复制事件的 CPU 排他有界；read "
"工作随显式调用方容量增长。"

msgid ""
"Platform admission checks line masks, triggers, pending and NVIC before "
"changing global clocks or GPIO. A shared SYSCFG gate has one generated owner"
" and retains a preexisting enable. Each line saves its mux nibble and "
"restores only that field after its own sources and independent vector are "
"observed withdrawn. GPIO cold leases restore the original input/analog state"
" at complete Platform stop. A failed cleanup keeps storage and recovery "
"responsibility. Wake binding checks actual IRQ policy and joins captured "
"callbacks before releasing storage. No public API, dynamic allocation, "
"worker, runtime registry or extra OS layer is introduced."
msgstr ""
"平台准入在改变全局时钟或 GPIO 前检查 line mask、trigger、pending 与 NVIC。共享 SYSCFG gate 只有一个生成"
" owner，保留先前 enable。每条线保存 mux nibble，仅在自身 source 和独立 vector 撤销后恢复该字段。完整 "
"Platform stop 时 GPIO cold lease 恢复原 input/analog。清理失败保留 storage 和 recovery "
"责任。Wake 绑定检查实际 IRQ policy，在释放 storage 前 join 捕获回调。不引入新公共 API、动态分配、worker、运行时"
" registry 或额外 OS 层。"

msgid ""
"The two authored EXTI fixtures select baremetal/FreeRTOS and exact three/two"
" event capacities. Native GoogleTest/GoogleMock executes the real provider "
"and generated two-line factory; ARM fixtures retain the selected "
"ops/handlers and actual FreeRTOS graph. Empty and existing GPIO/LPUART "
"fixtures remain separate regressions. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`: a"
" future admitted station must confirm PA0/PA1 accessibility and bias, inject"
" observed edges, compare instrument counts/waveforms with coalesced/loss "
"semantics, measure IRQ latency and prove source withdrawal before storage "
"reuse. Software success is not that evidence."
msgstr ""
"两份作者 EXTI 夹具选择 baremetal／FreeRTOS 及精确三／二事件容量。Native GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"执行真实 provider 与生成双线 factory；ARM 保留 selected ops/handler 和真实 FreeRTOS 图。Empty"
" 与既有 GPIO/LPUART 保持独立回归。物理 HIL 保持 `not_executed`：未来准入工位须确认 PA0/PA1 可接入性及 "
"bias，注入观察边沿，对比仪器计数／波形与 coalesced/loss 语义，测 IRQ 延迟并证明 storage 复用前 source "
"withdrawal。软件成功不是该证据。"

msgid "ADC1 shots and finite trigger blocks"
msgstr "ADC1 单次采样与有限触发 block"

msgid ""
"The acquisition fixture selects PA0/ADC1_IN1, single-ended 12-bit raw "
"counts, SYSCLK/128 = 1.328125 MHz, bulb sampling and sample code0 (2.5 "
"cycles). It owns the ADC12 common clock and explicit SYSCLK mux, rejects "
"other ADC owners, waits 22 us for the regulator and 5 us after calibration. "
"These delays preserve the 20 us and four-ADC-cycle minimums after 1 MHz time"
" quantization. ES0430 2.7.8--10 requires keeping the mux selected and "
"discarding the first conversion after idle or software STOP. Each enable and"
" conversion clears, barriers and reads back its own completion flags; stale "
"ADRDY/EOC cannot become new data. Each shot performs two conversions "
"separated by a 3 us wait and publishes only the second. The masked prime/arm"
" phase has one absolute 100 us deadline. Sampling is disabled before "
"returning or waiting for another block. Failed drain retains the calling "
"frame or producer loan. Declared reference voltage is nominal; raw counts do"
" not establish accuracy."
msgstr ""
"采集夹具选择 PA0/ADC1_IN1、单端 12 位原始计数、SYSCLK/128 = 1.328125 MHz、bulb 采样和 code0（2.5"
" 周期）。它拥有 ADC12 公共时钟和显式 SYSCLK mux，拒绝其他 ADC owner；稳压器等待 22 us，校准后等待 5 us，考虑 1"
" MHz 计时量化后仍满足 20 us 和四个 ADC 周期最小值。ES0430 2.7.8--10 要求保持 mux 选中，并丢弃空闲或软件 STOP"
" 后的首次转换。每次启用和转换都清理完成标志、执行屏障并读回，不能把旧 ADRDY/EOC 当作新数据。两次转换间等待 3 "
"us，只发布第二次。屏蔽中断的预热/使能阶段共用一个 100 us 绝对 deadline。返回或等待下一 block "
"前禁用采样器；排空失败保留调用帧或生产者借用。参考电压为标称值，不建立测量精度。"

msgid ""
"Finite DMA additionally owns TIM6, DMA1 channel1 and DMAMUX1 channel0 "
"request5. Each block is primed before arming. Exact rates 2.5--50 kHz must "
"divide the 1 MHz timer tick. RM0440 bulb sampling ends on the next trigger, "
"so SMPR alone does not bound its aperture. DS12288 Table66 limits it to 2.5"
"--640.5 ADC cycles: at the selected clock, the 20--400 us periods minus 12.5"
" conversion cycles give 14.0625--518.75 sampling cycles. After UG, CNT is "
"set to period minus ten; the first trigger follows ten timer ticks after "
"CEN, with the same 100 us deadline checked before and after enabling CEN. "
"The common SYSCLK source fixes these ratios. Host models cannot establish "
"analog timing or physical clock accuracy."
msgstr ""
"有限 DMA 额外拥有 TIM6、DMA1 channel1 和 DMAMUX1 channel0 request5，每个 block "
"前重新预热。仅接受精确整除 1 MHz 的 2.5--50 kHz。RM0440 bulb 采样在下一次触发结束，SMPR "
"本身不能限定孔径。DS12288 Table66 要求 2.5--640.5 ADC 周期；当前 20--400 us 间隔扣除 12.5 "
"周期转换后得到 14.0625--518.75 周期。UG 后 CNT=period−10，CEN 后十个 tick 首次触发，使能 CEN "
"前后检查同一 100 us deadline。共同 SYSCLK 固定这些比值；Host 模型不能建立模拟时序或物理时钟精度。"

msgid ""
"Halfword normal DMA never overwrites a consumer loan. IRQ stops the trigger;"
" task service observes DMA/ADC withdrawal and disabled ADEN before "
"publishing. The next service explicitly rearms an available block; "
"backpressure leaves the sampler disabled. READY/BORROWED blocks still "
"require consumer release. Close restores and reads back all owned timer, DMA"
" and mux configuration before releasing the lease; refused restoration "
"retains it for retry. The mode has trigger gaps and no hardware aperture "
"timestamp. ES0430 2.3.1 requires specific TC/HT/TE acknowledgement, never "
"global GIF clear on an active lane."
msgstr ""
"半字普通 DMA 不覆盖消费者借用。IRQ 停止触发；任务 service 观察 DMA/ADC 撤离且 ADEN 清零后才发布。下一次 service"
" 显式重装可用 block；背压保持采样器禁用，READY/BORROWED block 仍须消费者释放。close 恢复并读回所有 timer、DMA"
" 和 mux 配置后才释放责任，恢复失败保留并允许重试。模式有触发间隙，无硬件孔径时间戳。ES0430 2.3.1 要求只确认 "
"TC/HT/TE，不能对活动 lane 清全局 GIF。"

msgid "I2C1 finite master messages"
msgstr "I2C1 有限主机消息"

msgid ""
"I2C1 uses PB8/PB9 AF4 open drain, external pull-ups, HSI16 kernel, analog "
"filter, DNF0 and TIMINGR `0x30420f13`. Standard-mode rise at most 1000 ns "
"and fall at most 300 ns are Board requirements. One transaction has one to "
"eight 7-bit messages, each one to 256 bytes. A 256-byte message uses 255+1 "
"RELOAD chunks; messages use repeated START and one final STOP. STOPF and "
"cleared BUSY precede return. Errors reset the local controller and require "
"explicit recovery without GPIO pulses or replay. This does not prove a "
"physically stuck bus recovered. The private V2 engine has independently "
"asserted G474 SDK offsets and masks. ES0430 2.15.2 permits clearing master-"
"only spurious BERR and continuing; NACK, arbitration and overrun still "
"abort. Slave, IRQ and DMA modes are excluded."
msgstr ""
"I2C1 使用 PB8/PB9 AF4 开漏、外部上拉、HSI16 kernel、模拟滤波、DNF0 及 TIMINGR "
"`0x30420f13`。标准模式上升时间最多 1000 ns、下降时间最多 300 ns，由 Board 保证。一次事务含一至八条 7 "
"位地址消息，每条 1--256 字节。256 字节消息使用 255+1 RELOAD 分块；消息间使用 repeated START，最后只有一个 "
"STOP。STOPF 且 BUSY 清零后才返回。错误复位本地控制器并要求显式恢复，不脉冲 GPIO 或重放；这不证明物理卡住的总线已经恢复。私有 V2"
" engine 独立断言 G474 SDK 的偏移和掩码。ES0430 2.15.2 允许清除仅主机模式的伪 BERR 后继续；NACK、仲裁丢失和 "
"overrun 仍中止。不支持 slave、IRQ 或 DMA 模式。"

msgid "Full physical Flash"
msgstr "完整物理 Flash"

msgid ""
"The Flash face exposes all 512 KiB, two banks of 128 pages, 2 KiB erase "
"pages and 8-byte ECC programming units. DBANK=1, BFB2=0 and observed "
"FB_MODE=0 are required; the SYSCFG clock remains owned and observed before "
"reading the live mapping. Remapped banks and foreign Flash control modes are"
" rejected before unlock, data or erase effects. Page128 selects bank2/page0."
" There is no product reservation. The fixed software reference assumes 3300 "
"mV; the Board must confirm programming voltage. Geometry explicitly "
"advertises fresh-erase provenance: each written ECC line must come from a "
"real erase, which byte readback cannot prove. Each all-ones input unit skips"
" the physical pulse so it does not consume an erased ECC line. Program and "
"erase wait for any live pulse after an elapsed deadline and relock after "
"idle. Each pulse clears and reads back its own W1C status, checks the "
"prepared control mode, and requires a fresh EOP after BSY withdrawal; a "
"preceding page cannot provide its completion. RM0440 Category3 Table16 and "
"FLASH_SR.Bit0 require EOPIE for EOP to latch. EOPIE/ERRIE are explicitly "
"enabled only for the owned pulse while exclusively claimed FLASH_IRQn4 "
"remains disabled in NVIC. Cold/live enabled, pending, active IRQ or ECCIE "
"owners are rejected. Cleanup observes source withdrawal, clears status, then"
" clears NVIC pending and observes disabled, not-pending and not-active "
"before release without changing its priority. Failed cleanup retains a "
"retryable lease. ES0430 2.2.2 requires disabling data cache before pulses "
"and resetting it before restoring the original policy. Products own explicit"
" regions, watchdog, execution stalls and power-loss recovery. Option writes,"
" fast programming and mass erase are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Flash 暴露完整 512 KiB：两 bank、每 bank 128 个 2 KiB 擦除 page、8 字节 ECC 编程单位；要求 "
"DBANK=1、BFB2=0、实际 FB_MODE=0。读实时映射前必须持有并观察 SYSCFG 时钟。重映射 bank 和外来 CR "
"控制模式在解锁、数据或擦除动作前拒绝。Page128 选择 bank2/page0，无产品预留。3300 mV 为软件假设，Board "
"必须确认编程电压。geometry 显式声明真实新擦除来源要求；字节读回不能证明 ECC 未使用。全 FF 输入单位跳过脉冲，避免消耗擦除后的 ECC "
"行。活动脉冲不因 deadline 返回，idle 后重新加锁。每个脉冲先清理并读回自身 W1C 状态、检查控制模式，BSY 撤离后必须观察新 "
"EOP，不能继承前一页的完成。RM0440 Category3 Table16 和 FLASH_SR.Bit0 要求 EOPIE=1 才锁存 "
"EOP。仅为自有脉冲启用 EOPIE/ERRIE，独占 FLASH_IRQn4 且 NVIC 始终关闭。拒绝外来 "
"enabled/pending/active IRQ 或 ECCIE；清理先观察源撤离，清状态后清除 NVIC pending，确认向量已禁用、无 "
"pending 且无 active 后再释放，保持原优先级，失败保留可重试责任。ES0430 2.2.2 要求脉冲前关闭数据 "
"cache，复位后再恢复原策略。产品负责区域、看门狗、执行停顿和掉电恢复；不支持 option、快速编程或整片擦除。"

msgid ""
"Failed relock or cache restoration retains a private cleanup lease and "
"rejects further reads/writes. Platform stop retries the actual restoration "
"before releasing that state."
msgstr "重新加锁或 cache 恢复失败时保留私有清理责任并拒绝后续读写。Platform stop 会重试实际恢复，只有观察到成功才释放该状态。"

msgid ""
"These modes are separate software fixtures in "
"`tests/contracts/g474_assembly`. The exact official ADC/DMAMUX inline graph "
"is locked to STM32CubeG4 v1.6.3 driver "
"`f5929f431f9effe45fbe18f5337e4753ced9ac92`; Nexus retains transfer and IRQ "
"ownership. Production register models, generated factories and ARM links "
"have different exits from clean SDK reproduction and physical HIL. Every "
"physical result remains `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"这些模式在 `tests/contracts/g474_assembly` 中是独立软件夹具。实际官方 ADC/DMAMUX inline 依赖图锁定为"
" STM32CubeG4 v1.6.3 driver `f5929f431f9effe45fbe18f5337e4753ced9ac92`；Nexus "
"保留 transfer 和 IRQ 所有权。生产寄存器模型、生成 factory 和 ARM 链接，与 clean SDK 复现和物理 HIL "
"有不同退出条件。所有物理结果仍为 `not_executed`。"

msgid "Existing baseline evidence"
msgstr "既有基线证据"

msgid ""
"Actual host models execute the production register algorithm with official "
"SDK layout and masks. They verify bounded timeout, failed rollback, initial-"
"latch failure, source withdrawal, request alias rejection, wire drain, "
"overflow, callback borrow and independent state. They do not establish "
"oscillator, voltage, timing, peripheral errata or physical IRQ behavior."
msgstr ""
"真实 host model 以官方 SDK layout/mask 执行生产寄存器算法，验证有界 timeout、回滚失败、初始 latch "
"失败、source withdrawal、request alias 拒绝、wire drain、overflow、callback borrow "
"与独立 state；不建立 oscillator、voltage、timing、peripheral errata 或物理 IRQ。"

msgid ""
"The earlier baseline ARM C11 build with GCC 14.3 and the pinned official GCC"
" startup links empty, LED, UART and mixed bare-metal ELFs. The selected "
"types occupy System 56, GPIO 12, UART 72 and TX request 32 bytes. The small "
"profile costs are measured from those baseline ELF files and include the "
"2048-byte MSP reservation; they are not inferred from host sizeof or a size "
"promise for the expanded modes. Current resource and qualification records "
"must bind their exact selected configuration. Unselected GPIO/UART symbols "
"disappear through section GC."
msgstr ""
"早期基线使用 GCC 14.3、ARM C11 和锁定的官方 GCC startup，链接 empty、LED、UART 和 mixed bare-"
"metal ELF。选定类型大小为 System 56、GPIO 12、UART 72、TX request 32 字节。小型配置成本从这些基线 ELF"
" 测得，包含 2048 字节 MSP 预留；不是主机 sizeof 推断，也不是扩展模式的大小承诺。当前资源和资格记录必须绑定各自精确配置。未选中的 "
"GPIO/UART 符号通过 section GC 消除。"

msgid ""
"Generated typed factories, both OS backend compositions, clean reproducible "
"builds, exact SDK lock/bundle identities and any later Board HIL have "
"separate qualification exits. Software-only delivery must keep physical "
"status unknown."
msgstr ""
"生成类型化 factory、两种 OS 后端组合、clean 可复现构建、精确 SDK lock/bundle 身份与未来 Board HIL "
"都有独立资格退出条件。纯软件交付须保持物理状态 unknown。"

msgid "The ordinary `fixed-pwm` mode uses TIM3 CH1 PA6 AF2 or TIM4 CH1 PB6 AF2 with independent, exclusive whole-controller PWM. The reviewed base is edge-aligned upcounting and active-high, with tick clock 170 MHz divided by an integer 1..65536, period 1..65535 and duty 0..period. Duty uses CCR preload; a call does not imply an immediate electrical change. Zero and full duty are explicit constant levels. Runtime period/base changes, other channels, complementary outputs, capture, break, IRQ and DMA are unsupported. Start establishes a quiet UG epoch before exposing AF/output/CEN. Stop observes channel/counter withdrawal and the Board inactive GPIO level; failed close retains clocks, pin state and cleanup duty."
msgstr "普通 `fixed-pwm` 模式使用 TIM3 CH1 PA6 AF2 或 TIM4 CH1 PB6 AF2，分别独占整个控制器。已审基准为边沿对齐、向上计数、高电平有效，tick 时钟由 170 MHz 除以 1..65536 的整数得到，周期为 1..65535，占空计数为 0..period。占空更新使用 CCR 预装载；调用不意味着电气状态立即改变。零和满占空是明确的恒定电平端点。运行时更改周期／基准、其他通道、互补输出、捕获、break、IRQ 和 DMA 均不在此模式支持范围内。Start 在开放 AF／输出／CEN 前建立不向 TRGO 输出事件的 UG 计数起点。Stop 观察通道／计数器退出及 Board 不活动 GPIO 电平；close 失败则保留时钟、引脚状态和清理责任。"

msgid "The separate `shared-fixed-pwm` software reference selects exactly TIM3 CH1/PA6 and CH2/PA7 AF2. Two existing PWM factory faces and readonly channel references share one physical owner and one fixed tick/period configuration. The complete pair must agree on the base; another whole-TIM3 owner or PA6/PA7 user conflicts. Cold construction initializes both disabled channels once. Set stages only the selected CCR; a channel joining its running peer adopts the current phase without UG or counter restart. Neither coherent group start nor a full first pulse is promised. Channel stop withdraws its own enable and drives its own Board inactive GPIO; only the last lane stops the counter. The lifecycle caller quiesces both channel users before final Platform stop. One physical close may use exclusive reset before Platform restores both pin snapshots and releases added clocks. Failed close or outer restoration retains cleanup responsibility. The [canonical input](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/g474-pwm-shared.toml) uses a 1 MHz tick, 1000-tick period and Board-declared PA6-low/PA7-high inactive latches, with no timer IRQ or DMA. It does not establish PCB wiring, measured phase/pulse timing, electrical safety or HIL."
msgstr "独立的 `shared-fixed-pwm` 软件参考精确选择 TIM3 CH1/PA6 和 CH2/PA7 AF2。两个既有 PWM factory 接口及其只读通道引用共用一个物理 owner 和一份固定的 tick／周期配置。完整通道对必须使用相同基准；其他整个 TIM3 owner 或 PA6/PA7 使用者会产生冲突。冷态构造只初始化一次，两个通道均保持关闭。Set 只暂存所选 CCR；后启动的通道加入运行中的另一通道时沿用当前相位，不发出 UG，也不重启计数器。不承诺多通道同步启动或完整首脉冲。通道 stop 撤去自身使能，并将自身 GPIO 驱动至 Board 不活动电平；只有最后一个通道停止计数器。生命周期调用方须在最终 Platform stop 前确保两个通道的使用者均已停止访问。一次物理 close 可使用独占复位，然后 Platform 才恢复两个引脚快照并释放所增加的时钟。Close 或外层恢复失败时保留清理责任。[规范输入](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/io_evolution/g474-pwm-shared.toml)使用 1 MHz tick、1000-tick 周期和 Board 声明的 PA6 低／PA7 高不活动电平，不使用定时器 IRQ 或 DMA。它不证明 PCB 布线、实测相位／脉冲时序、电气安全或 HIL。"
